    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d173">

                <pb facs="0363" n="357" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg357"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Stevens</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 46.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-04-12"><hi rendition="#italic">April 12,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 50 of 19th ultimo, relative to a visit made that day by Her Majesty, the
                    Queen of the Hawaiian Islands, and by her Cabinet to the U. S. ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">San Francisco</hi>, in the harbor of Honolulu. The
                    Department has found pleasure in making its contents known to the Secretary of
                    the Navy.</p>
                <p>I am, etc;,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
